100% poliéster Não esquenta Escolha a Cor', 227.71, 227.71, NULL, 'Men Clothes > Costumes', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rbn3-lmhtll252u4ldd', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1064041628%2F22497172655', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
