a! Cornélio Autopeças – Qualidade que Move o Seu Veículo! 🚗💨', 68.9, 68.9, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Internal Accessories for Automobiles > Steering Wheel Cover', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-81zwn-min61ubz864hd6', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1556768667%2F18399872739', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
